From 97496fe3a578a63c45f10be0c2aa9062dc61a06c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 12:41:14 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] MiniMax-M3.1-Flash: device forward, launch planner and prompt
 driver (T8a)

forward_plan.zig writes one step's launch sequence as data (embed, 60 layers of
attention and dense or MoE FFN with the TP exchanges, head); forward_exec.zig
launches it through the existing exl3, norms, rows, sparse, act and rank_scatter
wrappers; forward.zig is the call API; prefill.zig is the chunk, mark and resume
driver. Host tests check the op order against the T0 model, the widths 1, 2, 3,
16, 17, 64, 128, dataflow and rank agreement. Step test-minimax-forward.
Never run on a GPU. Missing: the fp16 index projection kernel (see docs).

Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QguKy82jHfqdgzDsrrC5xs
Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
